<title>USA: FGIC qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Onsted Community School District, Mich., $11.575 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Fargo Public School District No. 6, N.D., $6.32 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
